# Discover is the first screen, and the merged answer is what its rows say: a
# book out at Montréal and free at BAnQ reads as available, and names BAnQ.
# Then a whole list, paged with buttons at both ends.
clean
expect Prêt numérique
expect Recent releases
expect Available now at BAnQ
expect Every copy is out at Montréal and BAnQ
expect Page 1 of 3
expect Previous page
expect Next page
tap Next page
wait-for En août, je lis québécois
clean
tap Previous page
wait-for Recent releases
clean
tap See the whole list
wait-for Recent acquisitions
expect Recent releases
clean
expect Page 1
tap Next page
wait-for Page 2
clean
tap Previous page
wait-for Page 1
clean
tap Mensonges
wait-for Book details
expect Available now at Montréal
clean
